    πα.1 ⁻¹ᵁ (ModularCurve.TwoChart.ιFin A (↥K) j).opensRange = (ModularCurve.TwoChart.ιFin A (↥(ModularCurve.laurentBaseChange L (ModularCurve.x1x0FunctionFieldC ℚ (M * p) (M * p * ℓ)))) jℓ).opensRange ∧
    πβ.1 ⁻¹ᵁ (ModularCurve.TwoChart.ιFin A (↥K) j).opensRange = (ModularCurve.TwoChart.ιFin A (↥(ModularCurve.laurentBaseChange L (ModularCurve.x1x0FunctionFieldC ℚ (M * p) (M * p * ℓ)))) jℓ).opensRange := by sorry
